        "Large dark ribbed/scalloped knob above a center-left vertical shaft; the shaft descends through upper support and bearing/collar hardware, plate region and lower support.",
        "A closely spaced repeated fixed plate bank spans the apparatus, while a second bank projects diagonally toward the front-right from the shaft, partly overlapping/interleaving with it.",
        "Spaces remain between visible successive plate layers. The source is not a solid dielectric slab and shows no external conductor joining the two banks.",
        "Upper and lower perimeter supports have open triangular bracing and corner fastening hardware.",
        "Two outer upright frame posts have top/bottom collars or fastening heads.",
        "A separate front-right upright plate-support/connection post has a top head and stacked spacer/collar detail and projects below the bottom frame.",
